**auto** 

Changes the [used value](CSS-CASCADE-5#used-value) of the [contain](CSS-CONTAIN-2#propdef-contain) property so as to turn on [layout containment](CSS-CONTAIN-2#layout-containment), [style containment](CSS-CONTAIN-2#style-containment), and [paint containment](CSS-CONTAIN-2#paint-containment) for the element.

